# Incremental Integration Prompt — Trustee Platform for Existing PayChain and PayKH Systems

PayChain and PayKH are already deployed and operational:

```text
https://paychain.cambobia.com
https://paykh.cambobia.com
```

Do not rebuild, replace or restructure these platforms unless an integration change is strictly necessary.

Build a new standalone platform:

```text
https://trustee.cambobia.com
https://api.trustee.cambobia.com
```

The Trustee Platform must integrate with the existing PayChain and PayKH systems using versioned APIs, signed webhooks, reconciliation feeds and secure service credentials.

---

