# 11. Initial Integration Sequence

Implement in this order:

1. Inspect existing PayChain APIs.
2. Inspect existing PayKH APIs.
3. Produce an integration-gap report.
4. Define shared identifiers.
5. Define OpenAPI contracts.
6. Define webhook event schemas.
7. Implement Trustee API authentication.
8. Implement PayKH payment-confirmation integration.
9. Implement PayChain reserve-status integration.
10. Implement PayChain mint-authorization integration.
11. Implement PayChain mint confirmation.
12. Implement PayChain redemption flow.
13. Implement PayKH program-fund tracking.
14. Implement merchant-settlement confirmation.
15. Implement three-way reconciliation.
16. Implement dashboards and exception handling.
17. Run end-to-end integration tests.
18. Deploy to Railway UAT.
19. Test with simulated bank transactions.
20. Prepare production-readiness report.

